{"id": "86270", "name": "מספר האיברים במכפלה קרטזית X×Y (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>If \\(X\\), \\(Y\\) are sets containing \\({{CT:0}}\\), \\({{CT:1}}\\) elements respectively, how many elements are there in the cartesian product, \\(X\\times Y\\), of the two sets?</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(| X \\times Y| = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>The cartesian product of sets \\(X\\) and \\(Y\\), \\(X \\times Y\\) is the set containing all ordered pairs with as first member an element of \\(X\\) and as second member an element of \\(Y\\).</p><p>For each element of \\(X\\), one can construct \\({{CT:1}}\\) different pairs, with \\({{CT:1}}\\) being the number of elements in \\(Y\\). Since there are \\({{CT:0}}\\) elements in \\(X\\), this will mean a total of \\({{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:1}}\\) pairs.</p><p>Hence the cardinality of \\(X \\times Y\\) is \\({{CT:2}}\\).</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:result]]", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "m", "n"], "nvariants": 50}